      "type": "text",
      "text": "Swallowed topical glucocorticoid: fluticasone from a multidose inhaler puffed into the mouth and swallowed (not inhaled), or budesonide 1-2 mg oral viscous slurry 30 minutes after breakfast and dinner; give at least 8 weeks."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
